{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-2","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2004,"convocatoria":"Reserva 2","documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-2.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-2-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la integral definida \\(I=\\displaystyle\\int_1^9\\frac1{1+\\sqrt x}\\,dx\\).","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Expresa la anterior integral definida aplicando el cambio de variables \\(1+\\sqrt x=t\\).","(1 p.) Calcula \\(I\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(1+\\sqrt x=t\\Rightarrow\\sqrt x=t-1\\Rightarrow x=(t-1)^2\\), y \\(dx=2(t-1)\\,dt\\). Límites: \\(x=1\\Rightarrow t=2\\); \\(x=9\\Rightarrow t=4\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(I=\\displaystyle\\int_2^4\\frac{2(t-1)}t\\,dt\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[I=\\int_2^4\\left(2-\\frac2t\\right)dt=\\Bigl[2t-2\\ln t\\Bigr]_2^4=(8-2\\ln4)-(4-2\\ln2)=4-2\\ln2\\]<div class='res'>\\(I=4-2\\ln2\\approx2{,}61\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"cambio","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-2-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"","apartados":["(1 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta tangente a la parábola \\(y=x^2\\) que es paralela a la recta \\(-4x+y+3=0\\).","(1,5 p.) Halla las ecuaciones de las rectas tangentes a la parábola \\(y=x^2\\) que pasan por el punto \\((2,0)\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La recta \\(y=4x-3\\) tiene pendiente 4. Busco el punto con \\(f'(a)=2a=4\\iff a=2\\): \\((2,4)\\).</p>\\[y-4=4(x-2)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=4x-4\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La tangente en un punto \\((a,a^2)\\) es \\(y-a^2=2a(x-a)\\iff y=2ax-a^2\\). Debe pasar por \\((2,0)\\):</p>\\[0=4a-a^2\\iff a(4-a)=0\\iff a=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ a=4\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='24.0,162.5 27.7,164.9 31.5,167.1 35.2,169.2 38.9,171.1 42.7,172.8 46.4,174.4 50.1,175.8 53.9,177.0 57.6,178.1 61.3,179.0 65.1,179.7 68.8,180.3 72.5,180.7 76.3,181.0 80.0,181.1 83.7,181.0 87.5,180.7 91.2,180.3 94.9,179.7 98.7,179.0 102.4,178.1 106.1,177.0 109.9,175.8 113.6,174.4 117.3,172.8 121.1,171.1 124.8,169.2 128.5,167.1 132.3,164.9 136.0,162.5 139.7,159.9 143.5,157.2 147.2,154.3 150.9,151.3 154.7,148.0 158.4,144.7 162.1,141.1 165.9,137.4 169.6,133.5 173.3,129.5 177.1,125.3 180.8,120.9 184.5,116.4 188.3,111.6 192.0,106.8 195.7,101.7 199.5,96.5 203.2,91.2 206.9,85.7 210.7,80.0 214.4,74.1 218.1,68.1 221.9,61.9 225.6,55.5 229.3,49.0 233.1,42.3 236.8,35.5 240.5,28.5 244.3,21.3 248.0,13.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,181.1 150.0,181.1 280.0,181.1' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='150.0,200.0 205.0,95.8 260.0,-8.4' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='160.0' cy='181.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='166.0' y='173.1'>(2,0)</text><circle cx='240.0' cy='29.5' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='194.0' y='27.5'>(4,16)</text><circle cx='80.0' cy='181.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='80.0' y='181.1'></text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 181.1H294.0M80.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='160.0' y1='178.1' x2='160.0' y2='184.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='157.0' y='195.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='240.0' y1='178.1' x2='240.0' y2='184.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='237.0' y='195.1' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='77.0' y1='105.3' x2='83.0' y2='105.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='64.0' y='109.3' font-size='10'>8</text><line x1='77.0' y1='29.5' x2='83.0' y2='29.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='64.0' y='33.5' font-size='10'>16</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(y=0\\) (tangente en \\((0,0)\\)) e \\(y=8x-16\\) (tangente en \\((4,16)\\))</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-2-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Denotamos por \\(M^t\\) a la matriz transpuesta de una matriz \\(M\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Sabiendo que \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}\\) y que \\(\\det(A)=4\\), calcula los siguientes determinantes: \\(\\det(-3A^t)\\) y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2b&2a\\\\-3d&-3c\\end{vmatrix}\\).","(0,75 p.) Sea \\(I\\) la matriz identidad de orden 3 y sea \\(B\\) una matriz cuadrada tal que \\(B^3=I\\). Calcula \\(\\det(B)\\).","(0,75 p.) Sea \\(C\\) una matriz cuadrada tal que \\(C^{-1}=C^t\\). ¿Puede ser \\(\\det(C)=3\\)? Razona la respuesta."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(|M^t|=|M|\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Una matriz y su traspuesta tienen el mismo determinante.</i> y, al ser de orden 2, al multiplicar por \\(-3\\) sale el factor \\((-3)^2\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Para una matriz de orden \\(n\\): \\(|kM|=k^n|M|\\), porque el factor sale de cada una de las \\(n\\) filas.</i>:</p>\\[\\det(-3A^t)=(-3)^2\\det A=9\\cdot4=36\\]<p>En el otro saco el 2 de la 1.ª fila y el \\(-3\\) de la 2.ª; después intercambio las columnas, lo que cambia el signo<i class='n' data-t='th'>Al intercambiar dos filas o dos columnas, el determinante cambia de signo.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2b&2a\\\\-3d&-3c\\end{vmatrix}=2\\cdot(-3)\\begin{vmatrix}b&a\\\\d&c\\end{vmatrix}=-6\\cdot\\left(-\\begin{vmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{vmatrix}\\right)=6\\cdot4=24\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\det(-3A^t)=36\\) y el segundo determinante vale \\(24\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\det(B^3)=(\\det B)^3\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El determinante de un producto es el producto de los determinantes.</i> y \\(\\det I=1\\): \\((\\det B)^3=1\\). El único número real cuyo cubo es 1 es el 1.</p><div class='res'>\\(\\det B=1\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\det(C^{-1})=\\frac1{\\det C}\\) y \\(\\det(C^t)=\\det C\\). Si \\(C^{-1}=C^t\\): \\(\\frac1{\\det C}=\\det C\\iff(\\det C)^2=1\\iff\\det C=\\pm1\\).</p><div class='res'>No: \\(\\det C\\) solo puede ser \\(1\\) o \\(-1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"det","apartados":"a, b, c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-2-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Halla la distancia entre las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=0\\\\y-1=\\dfrac{z-2}{-3}\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x-1=1-z\\\\y=0\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>En paramétricas: \\(r\\equiv(0,\\,1+t,\\,2-3t)\\) (con \\(y=1+t\\)) y \\(s\\equiv(1+\\mu,\\,0,\\,1-\\mu)\\) (con \\(x=1+\\mu\\)).</p><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(0,\\ 1,\\ 2)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(0,\\ 1,\\ -3)\\); \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(1,\\ 0,\\ 1)\\) con \\(\\vec v=(1,\\ 0,\\ -1)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales, así que las rectas se cortan o se cruzan. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(1,\\ -1,\\ -1)\\) calculo el producto mixto por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i><i class='n' data-t='th'>Si el producto mixto es 0 las rectas son coplanarias y se cortan; si no, se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1&-1\\\\0&1&-3\\\\1&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-1+3+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=3\\neq0\\]<p>Las rectas <b>se cruzan</b>. La distancia es la longitud del segmento \\(PQ\\) perpendicular a las dos (\\(P\\in r\\), \\(Q\\in s\\))<i class='n' data-t='why'>El segmento perpendicular común es el camino más corto entre dos rectas que se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[P(0,\\ 1+t,\\ 2-3t),\\quad Q(1+\\mu,\\ 0,\\ 1-\\mu),\\quad\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(\\mu + 1,\\ - t - 1,\\ - \\mu + 3 t - 1)\\]\\[\\begin{cases}\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec u=0\\\\\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec v=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}3 \\mu - 10 t + 2=0\\\\2 \\mu - 3 t + 2=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>Resolviendo: \\(t=-\\frac{2}{11}\\), \\(\\mu=-\\frac{14}{11}\\). Entonces \\(P\\left(0,\\ \\frac{9}{11},\\ \\frac{28}{11}\\right)\\) y \\(Q\\left(-\\frac{3}{11},\\ 0,\\ \\frac{25}{11}\\right)\\):</p>\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|=\\left|\\left(-\\frac{3}{11},\\ -\\frac{9}{11},\\ -\\frac{3}{11}\\right)\\right|=\\frac{3 \\sqrt{11}}{11}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-6,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"line\",[0.0,-0.782,7.345],[0.0,2.418,-2.255],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,2.418,-2.255],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.873,0.0,3.873],[1.327,0.0,0.673],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.327,0.0,0.673],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.0,0.818,2.545],[-0.273,0.0,2.273],\"#c2410c\",2.0,false],[\"line\",[0.0,0.897,2.308],[-0.075,0.671,2.233],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.075,0.671,2.233],[-0.075,0.592,2.47],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.096,0.0,2.096],[-0.021,0.226,2.171],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.021,0.226,2.171],[-0.197,0.226,2.348],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[0.0,0.818,2.545],\"P\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-0.273,0.0,2.273],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m04r2a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m04r2a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m04r2a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><